<title>HUNGARY: FORECAST - Hungary's T-bill yields seen dropping.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Hungary's T-bill yields seen dropping.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average yields on Hungary's one- and three-month discount Treasury bills were likely to drop as much as 0.1 percentage point at this week's auctions, a Reuters poll of four dealers showed on Monday.</p>
<p>Yields on the six- and 12-month bills were seen falling 0.08 to 0.4 percentage point, respectively, at this week's auctions.</p>
<p>The Government Debt Management Agency (AKK) will auction one-month treasury bills on Tuesday, three-month bills on Wednesday, six-month bills on Thursday and 12-month papers on Friday.</p>
